  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "Hello VR Chat,\nI know that you guys most have your hands full but this chat room is an epic room that goes beyond bounds. I think about second life and what they tried to do but vrchat does the interactions way better then second life.\nThere think that second life tried to do was too ahead of this time. I believe that it’s time for VrChat to and update to not Vr Community. There a lot of things that happen outside vr chat should happen inside the game.\nThere a lot that needs to happen to take the next steps to not be ahead but to blow the competition.\nDon’t want to really tells you what to do but I’m hoping that you guys can make the next update a human update, an update that can bring closer a virtual world as real life as possible.\nThank you",
